#EXTM3U
## Synthetic playlist in the shape plugin.video.movistarplus 0.11.9 exports
## (catchup="default" catchup-source="{catchup-id}" catchup-days="7" on every
## line). Ids, names and addresses are made up.
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="CH1" tvg-name="Canal Uno" tvg-logo="https://example.invalid/logos/ch1.png" tvg-chno="1" group-title="Movistar+" catchup="default" catchup-source="{catchup-id}" catchup-days="7",Canal Uno
plugin://plugin.video.movistarplus/?action=play&stype=tv&id=CH1

